<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">RRK59.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABAHEBURAAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha eyaahandiikiirwe Abaheburaayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaheburaayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EYAAHANDIIKIIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAHEBURAAYO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Omwana wa Ruhanga okukiza baamaraika ekitiinisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Ira Ruhanga akatuma baanabi ahari baatatenkuriitwe kubagambira omu miringo mingi etari emwe; <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omu biro ebi ebya bwanyima itwe akatutumaho Omwana we kuba niwe yaatugambira, ou yaataireho kuba omuhunguzi w'ebintu byona, kandi ou yaahangiise ensi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:4">2 Kor 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb 9:14</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo niwe kumurinkana kw'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga kandi ekishushani kye buzima, kandi niwe ahigika byona n'ekigambo kye eky'obushoboorozi. Ku yaaherize kuhikiiriza eky'okwozyaho ebibi, yaashutama aha rubaju rwa buryo orw'Ow'ekitiinisa omu iguru, <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:9">Fil 2:9</ref>. </char></note> yaakiza atyo baamaraika obukuru, nk'oku eiziina eri yaatungire ryahitsire agaabo.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Zab 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu n'oha ahari baamaraika ou Ruhanga aragizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Ori Omwana wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Eri izooba naakuzaara?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Nari ahandi ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Nyowe ndyamubeera Omuzaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Nawe ambeere Omwana?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kandi ahandi, ku yaareetsire omwana w'omujigaijo omu nsi, yaagira ati: Baamaraika boona aba Ruhanga bamuramye.<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Zab 104:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi baamaraika akabagambaho ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">Ohindura baamaraika be emiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">N'abaheereza be endimi z'omuriro.<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6">Zab 45:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka eby'Omwana we akagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Ekitebe kyawe ky'obukama, ai Ruhanga, n'eky'ebiro n'ebiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Enkoni yaawe y'obukama n'ey'okuhikiirira.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Okakunda okuhikiirira, waayanga obugomi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Nikyo Ruhanga, Ruhanga waawe, yaakushukiireho amajuta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">G'okushemererwa okukira bagyenzi baawe.<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Zab 102:25-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">Iwe, Mukama, omu kutandika okataho omusingi gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">N'eiguru rikahangwa emikono yaawe;<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Ebyo biryahwaho, kwonka Iwe oryagumaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">Ebyo byona biryakura nk'ekijwaro;<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Kandi oryabizinga nk'omunagiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Bihindurwe okundi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Kwonka Iwe tohinduka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">N'emyaka yaawe terihwaho.<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi n'oha ahari baamaraika ou aragizire ati;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">Shutama aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">Okuhitsya obu ndihindura abazigu baawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">Akatebe k'ebigyere byawe?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Baamaraika boona t'emyoyo erikuheereza, etumwa kukora omurimo gw'okuhwera abarihungura okujunwa?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Nikyo tushemerereire kuta omutima aha bi twahuriire, ngu tutahaba tukabirugaho. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:38">Byak 7:38</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 7:53">53</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ekigambo ekyagambirwe baamaraika, ku kiraabe kyahamire, kandi n'okushiisha kwona n'okutahurira kwona ku biraabe byahairwe ekifubiro ekibishemereire, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:25">Heb 12:25</ref>. </char></note> itwe turyakira tuta, ku turiba tuteetaire ha kujunwa okukuru okurikwingana kuti? Okujunwa okwo kukabanza kugambwa Mukama, twakuhamizibwa abaamuhuriire; <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:18">Mak 16:18</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref>. </char></note> kandi na Ruhanga yaakuhamya n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza n'eby'amahano by'emiringo mingi n'ebiconco by'Omwoyo Orikwera, ebi Ruhanga yaagabire nk'oku yaasiimire.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Ahakuba baamaraika ti bo Ruhanga yaahaire kutegyeka ensi eribaho, ei turikugambaho. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Zab 8:4-6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi hariho owaahamize ahandi ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Omuntu ni kintu ki, Iwe kumwijuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Nari Omwana w'omuntu, Iwe kumwetaho?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Omu mwanya mukye waamugarura ahansi okukira baamaraika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">Waamujweka ekirunga ky'ekitiinisa n'okuhimbisibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">Waamutegyekyesa emirimo y'emikono yaawe,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:27">1 Kor 15:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Waata ebintu byona ahansi y'ebigyere bye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ruhanga omu kumugomoorera byona taine ki yaatsigire kitari mu butegyeki bwe. Mbwenu hati titurikureeba bintu byona bimugomookyeire. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:8">Fil 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kureka owaagarwirwe ahansi omwanya mukye okukira baamaraika, niwe Yesu, nitumureeba ajwekirwe ekirunga ky'ekitiinisa n'okuhimbisibwa ahabw'okwemera obusaasi bw'okufa, ngu aroze aha kufa omu mwanya gw'abantu boona ahabw'embabazi za Ruhanga.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Ahakuba Ruhanga, Omuhangi wa byona, ou ebintu byona byahangiirwe, ku yaayenzire kutaasya abaana baingi omu kitiinisa, kikamushemerera kuhindura Omwebembezi w'okujunwa kwabo kuba ohikire ahabw'obusaasi. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:34">Mak 3:34</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:35">35</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Orikweza n'abarikwezibwa boona bakakomooka ahari Omwe. Nikyo atakwatirwa nshoni kubeeta beene Ishe, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Zab 22:22</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">Ndyagamba eiziina ryawe omuri beene Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">Ndyayeshongora eby'okukuhimbisa omu kanisa.<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:18">Isa 8:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ahandi ati: Ndyamwesiga. Kandi ahandi ati: Reeba ndi aha n'abaana abu Ruhanga yampaire.<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 1:10">2 Tim 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:10">Kush 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku abaana baine omubiri n'eshagama, nikwo nawe yaabigizire, ngu ahabw'okufa kwe ahindure busha ogwo oine obushoboorozi bwa rufu, niwe Sitaane, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />kandi ajune boona abatuura omu buhuuku ebiro byona eby'amagara gaabo ahabw'okutiina okufa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nitumanyira kimwe ngu baamaraika tibo ahwera, kureka baijukuru ba Abrahamu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo kikamushemerera kushushanisibwa na beene Ishe omuri byona, ngu abone kuba Omunyamurwa omukuru ow'embabazi kandi ow'ekwesigwa omu murimo gwa Ruhanga, ahongyerere ebibi by'abantu; <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:15">Heb 4:15</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba We, nk'oku yaabonabonesiibwe atyo, kandi akoohibwa, naabaasa kuhwera abarikwohibwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Oku Kristo akiza Musa ekitiinisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:14">Heb 4:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe abarikwera abakwataniise omu kwetwa okw'omu iguru, muteekateekye munonga ahari Yesu, Entumwa kandi Omunyamurwa omukuru ow'ediini ei turikwikiriza. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Akaba ari omwesigwa ahari Ogwo owaamutooraine, nk'oku Musa yaabaire ari omwesigwa omu nju ya Ruhanga; <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />kwonka Yesu ogwo akateekateekwaho ku ashemereire kuheebwa ekitiinisa ekirikukira ekya Musa, nk'omwombeki w'enju oku agira ekitiinisa okukira egyo nju. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />(Ahakuba enju yoona eyombekwa omuntu nanka, kwonka Omwombeki w'ebintu byona ni Ruhanga.) <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Kub 12:7</ref>. </char></note> Buzima kwo Musa akaba ari omwesigwa omu nju ya Ruhanga yoona, kwonka shi nk'omugaragwa ow'okuhamya ebyabaire nibiija kugambwa bwanyima; <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:19">Efe 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:23">Kol 1:23</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Kristo akaba ari omwesigwa orikutegyeka enju ya Ruhanga nk'omwana we. Kandi enju ye niitwe, ku turaabe nitugumiza kimwe obumanzi bwaitu n'okwesiimira ebi twineho amatsiko tuhamire okuhitsya aha muheru.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwerinda obugangaazi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Zab 95:7-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku Omwoyo Orikwera arikugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">Eri izooba, ku muraahurire eiraka rye,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Kur 17:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutagangaaza, emitima yaanyu, nk'oku mwagigangaize omu bunaku obu mwangomeiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">aha kiro eky'okugyezibwa omu ihamba,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Baashwenkuriimwe ei bantegyeire nibangyeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">Bakamara emyaka makumi ana nibareeba emirimo yangye.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Nikyo naagwerirwe kubi ab'obusingye obwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Ningira nti: Emitima yaabo ehaba obutoosha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Kandi tibakamanyire mihanda yangye.<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:21-23">Kub 14:21-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo naagiriire ekiniga nkarahira nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">Tibaritaaha mu buruhuukiro bwangye.<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />B'eishe-emwe, mwerinde, omuntu weena omuriimwe atagira omutima mubi ogutarikwikiriza, gukamuhabya kuruga ahari Ruhanga ohuriire. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:25">Heb 10:25</ref>. </char></note> Kureka muhaburane obutoosha, obunaku butakarengire; hatagira n'omwe omuriimwe owaagangaazibwa obugobya bw'ekibi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:11">Heb 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba tuhindukire abakwataniise omuri Kristo, ku turaabe nitugumiza kimwe ebi twabandize kwikiriza tutarikubanganisa okuhitsya aha muheru; <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />nk'oku kyagambirwe ngu: Eri izooba ku muraahurire eiraka rye, mutagangaaza emitima yaanyu, nk'oku mwagigangaize omu bunaku obu mwangomeiremu. <verse eid="HEB 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Nimugira ngu ni baahi abaahuriire, haza bakagoma? T'abo abaarugire Misri, beebembeirwe Musa? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:22-30">Kub 14:22-30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ni baahi abaamazire emyaka makumi ana nibamugwisa kubi? T'abo abaasiisire, abu emitumbi yaabo yaagwire omu ihamba? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Kandi ni baahi abu yaarahiriire okutataaha mu buruhuukiro bwe? T'abo abatarahuriire? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo nitureeba ngu bakaremwa kutaahamu ahabw'okutaikiriza.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Oburuhuukiro bw'abarikwikiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku endagaano y'okutaaha omu buruhuukiro bwe ekiriho, ka tutiine, omuntu weena omuriimwe atashusha nk'owaaremwa kubuhikaho. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ahakuba buzima naitwe tukagambirwa ebigambo birungi nka bo, kwonka ekigambo eki baahuriire tikirabagasiire, ahabw'okuba tikirashangire kwikiriza omuribo. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Mumanye ngu itwe abaikiriize tutaaha omu buruhuukiro obwo, nk'oku yaagizire ati: Nikyo naagiriire ekiniga nkarahira nti, Tibaritaaha mu buruhuukiro bwangye; n'obu emirimo ye eraabe yaahweire, okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Kut 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba hariho ahandi ahu yaagambire aha by'ekiro kya mushanju ati: Ruhanga akahuumura emirimo ye yoona aha kiro kya mushanju. <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Kandi hoona omu mwanya ogwo yaagira ati: Tibaritaaha mu buruhuukiro bwangye. <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku hakiriho bamwe ab'okubutaahamu, kandi abaagambiirwe ira obutumwa burungi baaremirwe kubutaahamu ahabw'okutahurira, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />nikyo Ruhanga yaateereireho ekindi kiro, eki yaayetsire “Eri izooba”, naakigambira omuri Daudi bwanyima y'ebiro bingi, (nk'oku kyaheza kugambwa eruguru,) ati: Eri izooba ku muraahurire eiraka rye, mutagangaaza emitima yaanyu. <verse eid="HEB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Bir 31:7</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba kuri noogira ngu Yoshua akabaha oburuhuukiro, Ruhanga takugambire ha kiro ekindi bwanyima. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />N'ahabw'ekyo hakiriho sabato y'okuhuumuriraho ebiikiirwe abantu ba Ruhanga; <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:13">Kush 14:13</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omuntu weena otaahire omu buruhuukiro bwa Ruhanga, biri ahuumwire emirimo ye, nk'oku Ruhanga yaahuumwire eye.<verse eid="HEB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo ka twezirikye kutaaha omu buruhuukiro obwo, hatagira omuntu weena owaagwisibwa okutahurira okw'omuringo nk'ogwo. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:29">Yer 23:29</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:17">Efe 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:48">Yoh 12:48</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ekigambo kya Ruhanga kiine amagara n'amaani, kiine obwogi bwingi okukira rurara yoona ey'amoogi abiri, nikicumita kihika ahu kitaanisiza amagara n'omwoyo, engingo n'omushokooro, kandi kirahuka kucaaka ebi omuntu arikuteekateeka n'ebi amaririire omu mutima gwe kukora. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Kandi omu maisho ge tihariho kihangirwe ekisherekirwe; kureka ebintu byona bishuurwirwe nibireebwa butunu omu maisho g'Ogwo oshoboorora ebyaitu.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 7:26">Heb 7:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nk'oku twine Omunyamurwa omukuru rugambwa, owaarabire omu myanya y'omu iguru, Yesu Omwana wa Ruhanga, ka tuhamize kimwe okwikiriza kwaitu; <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:17">Heb 2:17</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba titwine munyamurwa omukuru otarikubaasa kusaasira hamwe naitwe omu bweremwa bwaitu, kureka twine owaayohiibwe omu miringo yoona nkaitwe, kwonka We atashiishe. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:19">Heb 10:19</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ka twirire haihi n'ekitebe ky'embabazi tutaine bwoba, tubone kuheebwa okusaasirwa, n'okugirirwa embabazi z'okutuhwera ahu turaazeetengyere hoona.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="s1">Obunyamurwa bwa Kristo okukira obwa Arooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Nimumanya ngu omunyamurwa omukuru weena, otoorainwe omu bantu, aba atairweho kukora ebya Ruhanga ahabw'abantu, okuhonga empongano n'okutamba ebitambo ahabw'ebibi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:15">Heb 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Naabaasa kutwaza gye abataine bwengye n'abahabire, ahabw'okuba nawe ayehinguririziibwe obweremwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:6">Lev 16:6</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ashemereire kwetambirira ebitambo ahabw'ebibi bye, nk'oku abitambirira abandi. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kur 28:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tihariho oyeha obukuru obwo, kureka yaaba ayetsirwe Ruhanga, nk'oku Arooni yaayetsirwe. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Na mbwenu Kristo nawe tareekurize ngu aheebwe obunyamurwa obukuru, kureka akabuteebwaho Ogwo owaamugizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Ori Omwana wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Eri izooba naakuzaara;<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Zab 110:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> nk'oku yaagizire ahandi ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">Ori Omunyamurwa w'ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">Omu muringo gwa Melikizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:39-46">Mat 26:39-46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kristo, omu biro ebi yaabaire akiriho omu mubiri, akashaba yaayeshengyereza munonga naarira, yaatakira Ogwo owaabaasize kumukiza okufa; yaahurirwa ahabw'okutiina Ruhanga; <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />n'obu araabe yaabaire ari Omwana, akeega kworoba omu bi yaabonabonesiibwemu. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:17">Isa 45:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku yaaherize kuhikiirizibwa, yaahinduka obukomooko bw'okujunwa okutahwaho ahari boona abamworobera, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />ou Ruhanga yaayetsire Omunyamurwa omukuru omu muringo gwa Melikizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Ogwo twine bingi by'okumugambaho, kandi ebigumire eishoborora, ahakuba muhindukire abarikuhurira kubi. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:1-3">1 Kor 3:1-3</ref>. </char></note> N'obu muraabe mwabaire mushemereire kuba abeegyesa ahabw'okumara omwanya muhango nimwega, kwonka nimwetenga omuntu w'okugaruka kubeegyesa eby'okubandizaho ebyorobi omu byagambirwe Ruhanga. Kandi muhindukire abarikwetenga amate, bitari by'okurya ebigumire. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Mumanye ngu omuntu weena otungwa amate aba atakamanyiire kukoresa kigambo ky'okuhikiirira, ahakuba n'omwana; <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:19">Rom 16:19</ref>. </char></note> kureka eby'okurya ebigumire bishemereire abakuru, abu emitima yaabo eherize kumanyiira kutaanisa ekirungi n'ekibi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi k'okugaruka enyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ka turekye kwegyesa eby'okubandizaho ebya Kristo, tugumizemu tuhikye aha by'obukuru, tutagaruka kwombeka omusingi, nikwo kweteisa emirimo efiire, n'okwikiriza Ruhanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />n'okwegyesa eby'okubatiza n'eby'okutaho engaro n'eby'okuzooka kw'abafu n'orubanja orw'ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Kandi ekyo turyakikora, Ruhanga ku arisiima. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:26">Heb 10:26</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 10:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu abaabaire bajwereirwe omushana, bakaroza aha kiconco eky'omu iguru, bakahinduka abakwataniise omu Mwoyo Orikwera, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />kandi bakaroza aha burungi bw'ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'aha maani ag'obusingye oburiija, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />abo, ku bagwa baabirugamu, kiba kitakibaasika kubagarura bwa kabiri omu kweteisa, ahabw'okuba baba bagarukire kwebambira Omwana wa Ruhanga aha musharaba, n'okumukwatsa enshoni butunu. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Eitaka ku rihaaga enjura erigwireho kaingi, ryamera emboga ezishemereire abu rihingiirwe, Ruhanga ariha omugisha; <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Kut 3:17</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:18">18</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku rimera amahwa n'amatojo, riba ritakiine mugasho, riri haihi n'okukyeenwa; n'omuheru gwaryo kuri okwokibwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Kwonka, abarikukundwa, n'obu turaabe twagamba tutyo, nituteekateeka tutarikubanganisa ngu ebyanyu biri gye okukira ebyabo, kandi birimu okujunwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:34">Heb 10:34</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Ruhanga t'otahikiriire kwebwa emirimo yaanyu n'okukunda oku mwayorekire aha iziina rye, obu mwaheereza abarikwera, abu mukirikuheereza na hati. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Naitwe nitwetenga ngu omuntu weena omuriimwe ayorekye obweziriki, abone kugira amatsiko atarikubanganisa okuhitsya aha muheru; <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />murekye kuba abarikweganda, kureka mutooreze abo abahungura ebyaraganisiibwe ahabw'okwikiriza n'okugumisiriza.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amatsiko agu twine omu ndagaano ya Ruhanga n'endahiro ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:16">Kut 22:16</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba Ruhanga, obu yaaraganisa Abrahamu, akeerahira, ahabw'okutagira w'okurahira orikumukira, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />naagira ati: Buzima okukuha ndyakuha omugisha, kandi n'okukukanyisa ndyakukanyisa. <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Nikwo Abrahamu yaahairwe atyo eki yaaraganisiibwe, ku yaaherize kugumisiriza obutaruha. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:11">Kur 22:11</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu abantu barahira orikubakira, kandi omu mpaka zaabo zoona ekizimara n'okurahira. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo Ruhanga ku yaayenzire kworekyera kimwe abahunguzi b'ebi yaaraganiise, ku enaama ye etahinduka, yaagihamya n'okurahira; <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:29">1 Sam 15:29</ref>. </char></note> ngu ebintu bibiri ebitabaasa kuhinduka, ebi Ruhanga atabaasa kubeiheramu, bigumye emitima yaitu buzima, itwe abaamuhungiireho, tubone kuhamya eki twiineho amatsiko ekyatairwe omu maisho gaitu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lev 16:2</ref>. </char></note> Amatsiko aga tugaine nk'ekitsibo ky'amagara, n'amatsiko agahamire kandi agatarikunyiganyigibwa, agataaha Aharikwera munonga omunda y'omukingo, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />ahu Yesu yaabandize kuza ahabwaitu obu yaahinduka Omunyamurwa omukuru ow'ebiro byona omu muringo gwa Melikezedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Obunyamurwa bwa Melekizedeki okworeka obwa Kristo obutarihwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Kut 14:17-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba Melekizedeki ogwo, omugabe wa Salemu, omunyamurwa wa Ruhanga Rukira-boona, akabugana Abrahamu, naatabaaruka omu rugamba kwita abagabe, yaamuha omugisha; <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />kandi niwe Abrahamu yaahaire kimwe kya ikumi ekya byona. Melikizedeki ogwo okubanza n'omugabe w'okuhiikirira, nk'eiziina rye oku ririkushoboororwa, ekya kabiri n'omugabe wa Salemu, ekirikushoboororwa ngu omugabe w'obusingye. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Taine ishe, taine nyina, n'obu baakuba baishenkuru; taine butandikiro bw'amagara ge, kandi taine bugarukiro, kureka naashushanisibwa nk'Omwana wa Ruhanga, atuura ari omunyamurwa ebiro byona.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Muteekateekye aha muntu ogwo, mureebe ku ari mukuru munonga, ou Abrahamu tatenkuriitwe yaahaire kimwe kya ikumi eky'eminyago erikukira oburungi. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Kub 18:21</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku Ebiragiro biragiira ab'omuri baijukuru ba Leevi, abaheebwa obunyamurwa, kutwara kimwe kya ikumi ky'eby'abantu beene waabo, n'obu baraabe bakomookire ahari Abrahamu; <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />kwonka omushaija ogwo, otari w'omu ruganda rwabo, akatoijerwa Abrahamu kimwe kya ikumi, yaashabira omugisha ogwo owaabaire araganisiibwe. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Tihariho kubanganisa ku omuto niwe ashabirwa omukuru omugisha. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Kandi nk'oku biri hati, kimwe kya ikumi kiheebwa abantu abafa; kwonka omu bunaku obwo kikaheebwa ogwo orikuhamibwa ku ariho. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Nangwa nitubaasa kugamba ngu na Leevi orikuheebwa kimwe kya ikumi akabitoijera omuri Abrahamu ishenkuru; <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />ahakuba akaba akiri omunda ye, obu Melikizedeki yaamubugana.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obunyamurwa obwa Kristo okukira obw'Abaleevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Kuri noogira ngu okuhikiirizibwa kukatungwa ahabw'obunyamurwa bw'ekileevi, (ahakuba omu butegyeki obwo nimwo abantu baaheereirwe Ebiragiro) n'enki ekyakwetengyeise ondiijo munyamurwa kwimuka ow'omuringo gwa Melikizedeki, ateetsirwe omu muringo gwa Arooni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Ahakuba, ku haraabe hariho okuhinduka omu bunyamurwa, hashemereire kubaho okuhinduka n'omu Biragiro. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Kwonka Ogwo owaagambirweho ebyo n'ow'omu ruganda orundi, orutakarugwamuga muntu w'okuheereza aha itambiro. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:10">Kut 49:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nikimanywa ngu Mukama waitu akakomooka omuri Yuda; kandi oruganda orwo Musa tararugambireho by'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Kandi ekyo kikakira kumanywa gye, obu haimuka ondiijo munyamurwa orikushusha Melikizedeki, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />otaratooraniirwe bunyamurwa nk'ekiragiro ky'abantu nyabuntu oku kiragiira, kureka owaabuhairwe ahabw'okugira amaani g'amagara agatarikuhwerekyerezibwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Ahakuba bakamuhamya bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">Ori omunyamurwa w'ebiro byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">omu muringo gwa Melekizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Ahakuba ekiragiro eky'okubanza kikaihwaho ahabw'okutagira maani n'okubura omugasho; <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:9">Heb 9:9</ref>. </char></note> (mumanye ngu ekiragiro tikiine ki kyahikize buzima), haagarurwaho amatsiko agarikukira oburungi, agarikutwiriza haihi na Ruhanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Kandi ekyo tikirabaireho hatari ndahiro. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Abalevi bo bakaheebwa obunyamurwa, hatariho ndahiro; kwonka Owaabuhaire Ogwo akarahira, yaamugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Mukama akarahira, kandi taryefuuza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Yaagira ati: Ori omunyamurwa ow'ebiro byona.<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 8:6">Heb 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:24">12:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo Yesu yaabaire omwema ow'endagaano erikukira oburungi. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kandi abanyamurwa aba ira bakaba bakuratana baingi, ahakuba rufu ekaba ebazibira kugumaho; <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />kwonka Ogwo, ahabw'okugumaho ebiro byona, aguma ari omunyamurwa otarikurugaho. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:34">Rom 8:34</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo naabaasa kujunira kimwe abairirira Ruhanga nibaraba omuriwe, ahakuba atuura obutoosha bwona naabeeshengyerereza.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Kikaba kihikire itwe kugira omunyamurwa omukuru nk'ogwo, orikwera, otaine ki arikugaywa, otaine kamogo, otaanisiibwe n'abasiisi, owaakuziibwe okuba ahaiguru munonga aharikweshumba eiguru ryona. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Tarikushusha banyamurwa abakuru abandi, abeetenga kutamba ebitambo obutoosha, okubanza ahabw'ebibi byabo, bwanyima ahabw'ebibi by'abandi. Ahakuba ekyo We akakikora rimwe yaaheza, obu yaayehayo kuba ekitambo. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Mumanye ngu Ebiragiro bikataho abantu b'amaani makye kuba abanyamurwa abakuru; kwonka ekigambo ky'egyo ndahiro, kikataho Omwana wa Ruhanga owaahikiririziibwe kimwe okuhitsya ebiro byona.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'obunyamurwa obukuru bwa Kristo n'eby'Endagaano ensya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:14">Heb 4:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri ebyo ebi twagamba, ekirikukira obukuru nikyo eki. Twine Omunyamurwa omukuru nk'ogwo, oshutami aha rubaju rwa buryo orw'ekitebe ky'obukama obw'Ow'ekitiinisa omu iguru, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />orikuheerereza Aharikwera omu Ihema ery'amazima, eritarateirwe bantu, kureka eryateirwe Mukama. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Nimumanya ngu omunyamurwa omukuru weena ateebwaho okuhonga empongano n'okutamba ebitambo; n'ahabw'ekyo nawe ashemereire kugira eky'okuhonga. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Kuri yaabaire ari omu nsi, takubaire munyamurwa na kakye, ahakuba hariho abanyamurwa abashangwa bahonga empongano, nk'oku kiragiirwa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kur 25:40</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebyo ebi bakora n'enshusha kandi n'ebishushani by'eby'omu iguru; ahakuba Musa ku yaabaire naayenda kuteera eihema, akahaburwa Ruhanga owaamugizire ati: Oteho omutima, okore byona, noobishushanisa nk'ebi waareebire aha rushozi. <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:6">2 Kor 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati Kristo ahairwe obuheereza oburikukira obwa ira oburungi, ahabw'okuba We n'omuteerani w'endagaano erikukira oburungi, ahakuba neehamibwa ebyaraganisiibwe ebirikukira ebya ira. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Endagaano ey'okubanza kuri yaabaire etaine kishobiremu, tihaakwetengirwe ndiijo; <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yer 31:31-34</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Mukama akabahana naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">Reeba, ebiro biryaija, nikwo Mukama arikugira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">Obu ndiragaana endagaano nsya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">N'ab'enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda,<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Etarikushusha ndagaano ei naaragaine na baishenkurubo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Aha kiro eki naabakwatiire aha mukono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Kubaiha omu nsi ya Misri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ahakuba tibaragumire mu ndagaano yangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Nikyo naarekyeire kubataho omutima, nikwo Mukama arikugira.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Kwonka egi niyo ndagaano ei ndiragaana n'enju ya Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Bwanyima y'ebiro ebyo, nikwo Mukama arikugira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndyata ebiragiro byangye omu bwengye bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Kandi aha mitima yaabo niho ndibihandiika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Nyowe ndyaba Ruhanga waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Nabo babe abantu bangye.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kandi tibaryegyesana buri muntu na mutaahi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Nari shi omuntu weena na mwene ishe bati: Manya Mukama!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Ahakuba boona baryammanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru;<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Ahabw'okuba ndyabasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">N'ebibi byabo tindibiijuka bundi.<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:4">Rom 10:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama ku araabe naagamba atyo aha ndagaano nsya, biri aitsire ey'okubanza. Ahakuba ekirikukura, kikahanguura, kiba kiri haihi kuhwaho.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'Eihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Nimumanya ngu endagaano ey'okubanza ekaba eine emigyenzo eyaaragiirwe ey'okuramya Ruhanga, n'omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omu nsi egi; <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23">Kur 25:23</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:30">30</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:31">31</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba hakaba hariho Eihema eryakozirwe; omu mwanya gw'okubandizaho omuriryo hakaba harimu etabaaza n'emeeza n'emigaati y'okumurikwa; aho niho haabaire heetwa Aharikwera. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33">Kur 26:33</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 26:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omunda y'omukingo ogwa kabiri hakaba heetwa Aharikwera munonga, <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:33">Kur 16:33</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:21">25:21</ref>. </char></note> harimu eky'okwotereraho obubaane ekiheesirwe omu zaabu, n'eshanduukye y'endagaano eshwekirwe ezaabu embaju zoona, eyaabaire erimu orwabya rw'ezaabu orwabaire rubiikirwemu emaanu, n'enkoni ya Arooni eyaatookire, kandi n'ebishate by'amabaare g'endagaano; <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />ahaiguru yaayo hakaba hariho Baakerubi b'ekitiinisa basangiire ekitebe ky'okusaasira. Ebyo titurikubaasa kubitondoora buri kimwe.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ku baaherize kutebeekanisa ebyo byona, okuruga aho abanyamurwa baguma nibataaha omu mwanya ogw'okubanza kuhikiiriza emirimo y'okuheereza; <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lev 16:2</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omu mwanya ogwa kabiri hakaba hazamu omunyamurwa omukuru wenka rimwe omu mwaka, akaba atazayo ataine shagama y'okwetambirira n'okutambirira ebibi by'abantu ebi baakoreire omu butamanya, <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:19">Heb 10:19</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo Orikwera naamanyisa atyo, ngu omuhanda gw'okutaaha omu mwanya ogurikwera munonga tigukabonekire, eihema ery'okubanza rikiriho, (eririkutushobororera eby'obusingye obu.) <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:1">Heb 10:1</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 10:2">2</ref>. </char></note> N'omu biro ebyo bakaba bahonga empongano, batamba n'ebitambo ebitarikubaasa kushemeza buzima mutima gw'ogwo orikuramya Ruhanga, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />kureka bikwata aha by'okurya n'eby'okunywa n'eby'okwoga okw'emiringo etari emwe, niyo migyenzo eyaatairweho ahabw'omubiri okuhitsya aha biro by'okuhindurwa obusya.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugasho gw'eshagama ya Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Kwonka Kristo ku yaizire kuba omunyamurwa omukuru ow'ebirungi ebyabaire nibyenda kwija, yaaraba omu Ihema eririkukira obukuru n'okuhikiirira, (eritakozirwe bantu, amakuru ngu eritari ry'ebihangirwe by'omu nsi); <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />tarataahire mu Mwanya ogurikwera, aine eshagama y'embuzi nari ey'ente, kureka akataahayo rimwe yaaheza, aine eye; atyo yaatutungira okucungurwa okutahwaho. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:3">Lev 16:3</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 16:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 16:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu eshangama y'embuzi n'ente n'eiju ry'enyana y'eruutsi ebimiisiirwa aha bantu abasiisikaire ku biraabe nibyeza emibiri ekashemera, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:18">1 Pet 1:18</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 1:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:7">1 Yoh 1:7</ref>. </char></note> eshagama ya Kristo, owaayehaireyo ahari Ruhanga ahabw'Omwoyo Orikwera kuba ekitambo ekitaine kamogo, terikira munonga kushemeza emitima yaanyu kureka emirimo efiire, mukabona kuheereza Ruhanga ohuriire?<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 2:5">1 Tim 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo Kristo n'omuteerani w'endagaano ensya, ngu abaayetsirwe baheebwe obuhuunguzi obutahwaho obwaraganisiibwe ahabw'okufa kw'Ogwo owaafiire kucungura abaasiisire, abarikutegyekwa endagaano ey'okubanza. <verse eid="HEB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Nimumanya ngu, ahi endagaano ey'okuraga eri, hashemereire kubaho ekirikuhamya okufa kwa nyakuraga; <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />ahakuba endagaano ey'okuraga ehama, nyakuraga yaaheza kufa; ahabw'okuba tekora nyakuraga akiriho. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />N'ahabw'ekyo n'endagaano ey'okubanza terahamiibwe ahatari shagama. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:6">Kub 19:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Musa ku yaaherize kugambira abantu boona buri kiragiro ekyaragiirwe omu Biragiro, yaatwara eshagama y'enyana n'embuzi hamwe n'amaizi n'obwoya bw'entaama oburikutukura n'enyaweera, yaamiisiira ekitambo ky'ebiragiro n'abantu boona; <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kur 24:6-8</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Eshagama egi n'ey'endagaano ei Ruhanga yaabaragiire. <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima egyo shagama yaagimiisiira atyo Eihema n'ebintu byona ebyabaire nibikoresibwa emirimo y'obuheereza. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lev 17:11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Buzima omu Biragiro haihi buri kintu kyezibwa eshagama; kandi ahatari kusheesha shagama, tihariho kwihwaho bibi.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo okutaaha omu iguru ahabwaitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo kikaba kihikire ebishushani by'eby'omu iguru kwezibwa ebyo; kwonka eby'omu iguru byo byezibwa ebitambo ebirikukira ebyo. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:1">1 Yoh 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Kristo tarataahire mu mwanya ogurikwera ogwakozirwe abantu, ogurikushushanisibwa nk'ogwo ogw'amazima, kureka akataaha omu iguru buzima ngu ayeyorekye hati omu maisho ga Ruhanga ahabwaitu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Taragiireyo kwehayo kaingi, nk'omunyamurwa omukuru oku yaabaire ataaha omu mwanya ogurikwera buri mwaka, aine eshagama etari ye ahabwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:4">Gal 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Kuri kyabaire kityo, akaabaire ashemereire kubonabonesibwa kaingi okwiha aha kuhangwa kw'ensi; kwonka hati mbwenu aha muheru gw'obusingye obwo akareebeka rimwe yaaheza, ngu abone kwihaho ebibi ahabw'okwehayo kuba ekitambo. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Kandi nk'oku abantu bateereirweho okufa rimwe, bwanyima yaakwo bakacwerwa orubanja, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:20">Fil 3:20</ref>. </char></note> nikwo na Kristo, ku yaaherize kuheebwayo rimwe kwekorera ebibi bya baingi, aryareebeka omurundi gwa kabiri, ti habw'ebibi, kureka ahabw'okujuna abariba bamutegyereize.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo okuba ekitambo ekirikukira ebindi bitambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 7:19">Heb 7:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiragiro ahabw'okushusha ebirungi ebyabaire nibyenda kwija, bitari byo buzima, tibibaasa kuhikiiriza abantu abarikwirira haihi ahabw'ebitambo ebyo ebyabaire biheebwayo obutoosha buri mwaka. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Kuri kyabaire nikibaasika, tibyakurekirwe kutambwa? Ahakuba abarikuramya, ku baakuherize kushemezibwa rimwe buzima, tibaakugarukire kwemanyaho bibi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Kwonka ebitambo ebyo bikaba bibaijutsya ebibi byabo buri mwaka; <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />ahakuba eshagama y'enimi n'ey'embuzi tebaasa kwihaho bibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Zab 40:6-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo Kristo, ku yaabaire naija omu nsi, yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">Ebitambo n'empongano torabikunzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">Kureka okanteekateekyera omubiri;<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ebitambo ebyokiibwe ebitambwa ahabw'ebibi ti byo waasiimire.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Nyowe nikwo kugira nti: Ai Ruhanga reeba, naija kukora ebi okunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ahariinye omu muzingo gw'ekitabo.<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Omu bi arikugamba aharuguru, ku yaaherize kugira ati: Ebitambo n'empongano n'ebitambo ebyokiibwe ebiheebwayo ahabw'ebibi torabisiimire n'obu kwakuba okubishemerererwa, (ebyo nibyo biheebwayo nk'oku Ebiragiro biragiira) <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />yaagaruka yaagira ati: Reeba, naija kukora ebi okunda. Atyo yaihaho eby'okubanza, ngu ahamye ekya kabiri. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:12">Heb 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri ekyo eki akunda itwe tukeezibwa ahabw'okuheebwayo kw'omubiri gwa Yesu Kristo rimwe akaheza.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Nimumanya ngu omunyamurwa weena ayemerera obutoosha omu rubu rwe, naatamba ebitambo kaingi ebitahinduka ebitarikubaasa kwihaho bibi ebiro byona; <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />kwonka Kristo we, ku yaaherize kutamba ekitambo kimwe eky'ebiro byona ahabw'ebibi, yaashutama aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga; <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>. </char></note> okwiha obwo atuura ategyereize, okuhitsya obu abazigu be barihindurwa akatebe k'ebigyere bye. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Ahakuba abarikwezibwa akabahikiiriza ahabw'ekitambo kimwe yaaheza okumara ebiro byona. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Kandi Omwoyo orikwera nawe naabituhamiza; ahakuba ku yaaherize kugamba ati:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Egi niyo ndagaano ei ndiragaana nabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Bwanyima y'ebiro ebyo, nikwo Mukama arikugira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Ndyata ebiragiro byangye omu mitima yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Kandi mbihandiikye omu bwengye bwabo.<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">Ebibi byabo n'eby'okushiisha byabo tindibiijuka bundi.<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Kandi ahi ebibi bisaasiirwe, haba hatakiriho kutamba kitambo ahabw'ekibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutucwera omuhanda musya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:51">Mat 27:51</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, nk'oku twine obumanzi kutaaha Aharikwera munonga ahabw'eshagama ya Yesu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:8">Heb 9:8</ref>. </char></note> nituraba omu muhanda musya ogw'amagara, ogu yaatucwereire omu mukingo, nigwo mubiri gwe, <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />kandi nk'oku twine omunyamurwa omukuru orikutegyeka enju ya Ruhanga, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36:25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:26">Efe 5:26</ref>. </char></note> ka twirire haihi n'omutima gw'amazima nitwikiririza kimwe tutarikubanganisa, twine emitima emiisiirwe okwihwaho ebibi ebi emyoyo yaitu erikutushinja, kandi n'emibiri yaitu eyogiibwe amaizi amarungi. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:14">Heb 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Ka tugumizemu kuhamya amatsiko gaitu tutarikunyiganyiga, ahabw'okuba Owaaraganiise n'omwesigwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Kandi ka tuteekateekye oku twakwezirikisana kukundana n'okukora ebirungi, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:13">Heb 3:13</ref>. </char></note> tutarikureka kuteeranira hamwe, nk'oku abamwe bagira, kureka tugumyane, kandi nk'oku murikureeba ngu ekiro ekyo kiri haihi n'okuhika, mweyongyere kutwaza mutyo.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro ky'abarikugaya Omwana wa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 6:4-8">Heb 6:4-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba itwe abaaherize kuheebwa okumanya amazima, kutugaruka twashiisha nkana, haba hatakiriho kitambo ahabw'ebibi, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />kureka hatsigara kutegyereza n'obwoba okucwerwa orubanja, n'omuriro gw'ekibabo oguryokyeza kimwe abazigu ba Ruhanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Bir 17:6</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku agomera ekiragiro kya Musa, yaashinjwa abantu bashatu nari babiri, tasaasirwa, aitwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Mbwenu owaateire Omwana wa Ruhanga omugyere, akateekateeka aha shagama y'endagaano ei yaayeziibwemu okuba etaine mugasho, akarogota aha Mwoyo ow'embabazi, nimuteekateeka ngu tashemereire kifubiro kihango ekirikukira ekyabo? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom 12:19</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nitumanya Ogwo owaagizire ati: Okuhoora enzigu n'okwangye; niinye ndiihura. Kandi ati: Mukama aryacwera abantu be orubanja. <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Heb 12:29</ref>. </char></note> Ka n'eihano omuntu okugwa omu mikono ya Ruhanga ohuriire!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugumisiririza obusaasi ahabw'ebihembo by'omu iguru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Kwonka mwijukye ebiro ebyahingwire, muherize kujwerwa omushana, oku mwagumisiririize engamba nyingi n'obusaasi; <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:9">1 Kor 4:9</ref>. </char></note> obundi mukahinduka ab'okushungwa nibabajuma nibababonabonesa; obundi mukakwatanisa n'abarikugirwa batyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:20">Mat 6:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba mukagirira embohe esaasi, kandi imwe ahabwanyu mwaikiriza n'okushemererwa kunyagwa ebi mutungire, ahabw'okumanya ngu imwe mwine eitungo eririkukira oburungi, kandi eritahwaho. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />N'ahabw'ekyo mutarinaga okugumisiriza kwanyu okwine ebihembo bingi; <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:19">Luk 21:19</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba nimwetenga kugumisiriza, ku muriheza kukora ebi Ruhanga akunda, mubone kuheebwa ebyaraganisiibwe.<verse eid="HEB 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:28">Luk 21:28</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:3">Hab 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hatsigaire akaanya kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">Orikwija aryaija, tariikarayo;<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:11">Gal 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka owangye ohikiriire aryaba ohuriire ahabw'okwikiriza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">Kandi ku agaruka enyima, omutima gwangye tigumushemerererwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Kwonka itwe tituri muri abo abarikugaruka enyima, bakahwerekyerera, kureka turi omuri abo abarikwikiriza, bakajuna amagara gaabo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Amakuru g'okwikiriza; n'obumanyiso bw'amamanzi agaikiriize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Okwikiriza nikwo kuhamiza kimwe ebi twineho amatsiko, kandi nikwo kutumanyisiza kimwe ebitarikureebwa; <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:7">2 Kor 5:7</ref>. </char></note> abakuru aba ira bakasiimwa Ruhanga ahabw'okukugira. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Kut 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Okwikiriza nikwo kutumanyisa ku ensi yaahangirwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga, kandi n'ebirikureebwa ku bitarahangirwe mu bintu ebiriho.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:4">Kut 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okwikiriza Abeeli akahayo ekitambo ekirikusiimwa ahari Ruhanga okukira ekya Kaini; nikyo kyamuhamize ku ahikiriire, kandi Ruhanga yaabihamya naayakiira ebi yaamutoijeire, kandi ahabw'okwikiriza okwo n'obu araabe yaafiire, naakigamba. <verse eid="HEB 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:24">Kut 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza Enoka akatwarwa omu iguru ngu arekye kufa; tiyaagaruka kureebwa, ahakuba Ruhanga, akamutwara. Kandi ku yaabaire atakatwairwe, akahamibwa ku ashemeize Ruhanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kandi otarikwikiriza tarikubaasa kumushemeza; ahakuba omuntu weena orikwija ahari Ruhanga, ashemereire kwikiriza ku ariho, kandi ku aha ebihembo abamusherura. <verse eid="HEB 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Kut 6:13-22</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 7:1">7:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Noa ku yaahabwirwe Ruhanga aha byabaire bitakabaireho, akamworobera, yaakora emeeri ey'okukiza ab'omu nju ye; n'ahabw'ekyo akasingisa ensi orubanja, yaahinduka omuhunguzi w'okuhikiirira okurikuruga omu kwikiriza. <verse eid="HEB 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Kut 12:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 12:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Abrahamu ku yaayetsirwe kuruga owaabo kuza omu nsi ei yaabaire naaza kuheebwa kuba obuhunguzi, akooroba, yaarugayo, atarikumanya ei arikuza. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Kut 23:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza akatuura nk'omwaijaija omu nsi ei yaaraganisiibwe, nk'etari yaabo, yaaguma omu mahema na Isaaka na Yakobo, abahunguzi b'ebyaraganisiibwe hamwe nawe. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ahakuba akaba aine amatsiko g'okutaaha omu rurembo orwine emisingi, oru Ruhanga yaagyezire, kandi akarwombeka. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2">Kut 21:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, na Saara akaheebwa amaani kugira enda, n'obu araabe yaabaire akaikwire, ahakuba akateekateeka ahari Ogwo owaamuraganiise ku ari omwesigwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:19">Rom 4:19</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu omwe, kandi owaabaire ari nk'ofiire, yaakomookwaho abaijukuru baingi nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, kandi nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja ogutarikubarwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:12">Zab 39:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:11">1 Pet 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Abo boona bakafa bakiri omu kwikiriza, batakahairwe bi baaraganisiibwe, kwonka bakaba babireebera hare, baabyesiimira, baahamya ku bari abagyenyi kandi abagyenzi omu nsi egi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Ahakuba abarikugamba batyo baba nibamanyisa ku barikusherura ensi yaabo buzima. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Kuri baajuzire ensi egyo ei baarugiremu, bakaabaasize kugarukayo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:2">Yoh 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati nibeetenga ensi erikukira oburungi, niyo y'omu iguru; nikyo Ruhanga atakwatirwa nshoni kwetwa Ruhanga waabo, ahakuba akabateekateekyera orurembo.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:1">Kut 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:22">Yak 2:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Abrahamu ku yaagyeziibwe, yaahayo Isaaka; kandi owaahairwe ebyaraganisiibwe yaikiriza kuhayo omwana we omwe nyamunegyere, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />owaabaire agambirweho ngu: Omuri Isaaka nimwo baijukuru baawe baryetererwa; <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rom 4:17</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba akateekateeka ngu Ruhanga naabaasa kuzoora abafu: nikyo yaamugaruriirwe nk'owaaruga omu bafu. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Ahabw'okwikiriza, Isaaka akashabira Yakobo na Esau omugisha ogw'ebiribaho bwanyima. <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:15">Kut 48:15</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 48:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Yakobo ku yaabaire ari haihi kufa, yaashabira abaana ba Yosefu bombi omugisha, naaramya Ruhanga ayehigikire eifundo ry'enkoni ye. <verse eid="HEB 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:25">Kut 50:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Yosefu ku yaabaire ari haihi kufa, yaagamba ha by'okuruga Misri kw'Abaisraeli, kandi yaabaragiira n'eby'okuziikwa kwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kur 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, abazaire ba Musa ku baamuzaire, baamushereka ameezi ashatu, ahakuba bakareeba ku ari omwana murungi; kandi tibaatiina kiragiro ky'omugabe. <verse eid="HEB 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10">Kur 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Musa ku yaakuzire, yaayanga kwetwa mutabani wa muhara wa Faraho, <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />yaihamu okukorwa kubi hamwe n'abantu ba Ruhanga, yaayanga kuguma omu by'okweshemeza by'ekibi ebirikuhwaho juba. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Zab 69:9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:13">Heb 13:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaateekateeka okujumwa naaturwa Kristo ku kuri eitungo ringi okukira obutungi bwa Misri; ahakuba akaba ategyereize ekihembo eki ariheebwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:12">Kur 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13">13</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, akaruga Misri atatiinire kiniga ky'omugabe; ahakuba akagumisiriza, amaisho agataire ahari Ogwo otareebwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Ahabw'okwikiriza akataho Okuhingurwaho, kandi yaamiisiira eshagama, ngu ogwo owaabaire naacwekyereza emijigaijo atakaabakoraho. <verse eid="HEB 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:22">Kur 14:22</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Abaisraeli bakaraba omu Nyanja erikutukura nk'abarikuraba ahoomire; kwonka Abanyamisri ku baateireho kurabamu, baamirwa amaizi. <verse eid="HEB 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:20">Yos 6:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, orugo rw'amabaare rwe Yeriko rukagwa bwanyima y'okurweziguruka amazooba mushanju. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:11">Yos 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 2:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:17">6:17</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 6:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:25">Yak 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwikiriza, Rahabu maraaya taracwekyereire hamwe n'abandi abaabaire bari abagomi, ahakuba aka kunira gye entatsi.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Mbwenu ngambe mpitsye hi? Ahakuba omwanya gukaampwaho, ku naakuza kugamba ebya Gideoni, Baraki, Samusooni, Yefusa, Daudi na Samueli na baanabi: <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:6">Bar 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:22">Dan 6:22</ref>. </char></note> abaasingwire obundi bugabe ahabw'okwikiriza, abaakozire eby'okuhikiirira, abaahairwe ebyaraganisiibwe, abaabumbire eminwa y'entare, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:23-25">Dan 3:23-25</ref>. </char></note> abaaraize ekibabo ky'omuriro, abaakizire obwogi bwa rurara, abaarugire omu bweremwa, bakatunga amaani, abaahindukire amamanzi omu ngamba, abaabingire engabo z'amahanga agandi. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:36">2 Bag 4:36</ref>. </char></note> Abakazi bakagarurirwa abafu baabo abaazoirwe. Abamwe bakateerwa ez'okubaita, batarikwenda kurekurwa, ngu nyentsya babone kuheebwa okuzooka okurikukira oburungi. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Abandi bakashekyererwa, abandi bakaashwa, abandi bakabohwa n'enjegyere, baatebwa omu bihome; <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Bus 24:21</ref>. </char></note> abandi bakateerwa amabaare, baasharwamu habiri n'emisimeeno, abandi bakarengwa buzima, baitwa zaarurara, abandi bakazengyerera bajwaire empu z'entaama n'ez'embuzi, baconcoboize, nibabonabonesibwa, nibaitwa kubi; <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />abu ensi etarashemereire ngu bagituuremu; nibazengyerera omu mahamba n'omu nshozi, nibaraara omu maaya n'omu biina omu itaka.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Abo boona, n'obu baraabe bahamiibwe ahabw'okwikiriza kwabo, tibaratungire bi baaraganisiibwe, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />ahakuba Ruhanga akatuteekateekyera ira ekirikukira oburungi, ngu barekye kuhikiirizibwa, itwe tutariho.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okugumisiririsa ebigyezo ahabw'okureeba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 10:36">Heb 10:36</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:24">1 Kor 9:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku twine omutwe muhango gwa baakareebi abatwehinguririize, tujuure ebirikuturemeera byona n'ekibi ekitwezingiriire, twirukye okwiruka okw'empaka oku tuteereirweho n'okugumisiriza, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:5">Zab 34:5</ref>. </char></note> amaisho tugahangire Yesu wenka, owaatandikire okwikiriza kwaitu kandi omuhikiiriza waakwo; owaayemeire omusharaba ahabw'okushemererwa okwatairweho omu maisho ge, akagaya enshoni zaagwo, kandi hati ashutami aha rubaju rwa buryo rw'ekitebe ky'obukama bwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 2:34">Luk 2:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muteekateekye ahari Ogwo, owaagumisiririize okwangwa kutyo oku abasiisi baamwangire, murekye kuruha n'okugwa enshazi omu mitima yaanyu. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Imwe timukahikire ha kujwisibwa eshagama nimurwana n'ekibi. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">Enf 3:11</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Mwebirwe ekigambo ekirikubeehanangiriza nk'abaana kiti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">Mwana wangye, otagaya okuhana kwa Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">Kandi otagwa enshazi ku araakuhane.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 3:19">Kush 3:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ou Mukama akunda niwe ahana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">Kandi ateera omwana weena ou aikiriza.<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Mugumisiririze okuhanwa; ahakuba Ruhanga naabatwaza nk'abaana; mbwenu ni mwana ki ou ishe atahana? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Kwonka ku muraabe mutarikuhanwa nk'abandi boona nimuba mutari baana, kureka ebizaarwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kandi hoona tukaba twine baatataitwe ab'omu nsi abaabaire batuhana, naitwe tukaba tuboorobera. Mbwenu titushemereire kukizaho kworobera Ishe w'emyoyo yaitu, tukagira amagara? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Ahakuba abo bakaba batuhana ebiro bikye nk'oku baabaire basiima; kwonka We atuhana ngu tugasirwe, kandi tukwatanise nawe omu kuhikiirira kwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:17">2 Kor 4:17</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 4:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku aba naakihanwa, tashemererwa kureka ashaasha; kwonka abamanyiziibwe okuhanwa, bwanyima kubarugiramu ebyana by'okuhikiirira ebirikureeta obusingye.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo mwimutsye emikono yaanyu enoganogokire, munanuure amaju gaanyu agazingazingirwe, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Enf 4:26</ref>. </char></note> mucwere ebigyere byanyu emihanda eshororokire, abarikucumbagira barekye kugiremerwamu, kureka bakire. <verse eid="HEB 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:14">Zab 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:22">2 Tim 2:22</ref>. </char></note> Mwezirikye okugira obusingye n'abantu boona, kandi n'okwezibwa; ahakuba ahatari kwezibwa tihariho orireeba Mukama. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Bir 29:18</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde hatagira omuntu owaagwa akaruga omu mbabazi za Ruhanga, haza omuzi ogurikushaarira ogwabameramu, gukabatuntuza emitima, n'abaingi bakasiisikara; <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:33">Kut 25:33</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 25:34">34</ref>. </char></note> kandi hatabaho omushambani weena, nari otarikweta ha bya Ruhanga nka Esau owaagurize obuhunguzi bwe bw'omujigaijo akaihuro k'eby'okurya. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Kut 27:30-40</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nimumanya ngu, bwanyima ku yaayenzire kuragwa omugisha ogwo, akangirwa, tiyaabona buryo bw'okweteisa, n'obu araabe yaagushabire naarira.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Endagaano nsya okukira eya ira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Bir 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi imwe timwizire ha rushozi orurikuhikwaho, orurikubugumwaho omuriro, n'obu haakuba aharikwiririmba n'omu mwirima ndindindi, n'eihunga ry'amaani, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Kur 19:12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref>. </char></note> n'okugamba kw'enzamba, n'eiraka ry'ebigambo; abaarihuriire bakeeshengyereza ngu batagambirwa ebindi. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Ahabw'okuba tibareemeire kyaragiirwe ngu, Ekirihika aha rushozi orwo kyona, n'obu kyakuba ekitungirwe, kiteerwe amabaare. <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Kandi n'ebyareebirwe bikaba nibitiinisa; nikyo Musa yaagiriire ati: Nyine obwoba bwingi nintetema. <verse eid="HEB 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:1">Kush 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">21:2</ref>. </char></note> Kureka mwizire aha rushozi Saayuuni, omu rurembo rwa Ruhanga ohuriire, Yerusaalemu orw'omu iguru, n'ahari baamaraika abateeraine omu mitwe etarikubarwa, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />n'omu iteraniro ry'emijigaijo ehandiikirwe omu iguru, kandi mwizire n'ahari Ruhanga omucwi w'emanja za boona, n'emyoyo y'abahikiriire abaahikiriziibwe, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:15">Heb 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 4:10">Kut 4:10</ref>. </char></note> n'ahari Yesu omuteerani w'endagaano ensya, n'eshagama erikumiisiirwa, erikugamba ebirungi okukira eya Abeeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:2">Heb 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwerinde, mutanga kuhurira Ogwo orikugamba. Ahakuba abaayangire kworobera owaabahaniire omu nsi, ku baraabe batarakizire, itwe turyakira tuta ku turyanga kworobera Ogwo otuhana naayema omu iguru. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref>. </char></note> Obwo eiraka rye rikatengyetsa ensi; kwonka hati araganiise ati: Niinyija kugaruka kutengyetsa ensi rimwe, kandi ti nsi yonka kureka n'eiguru. <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Ekigambo eki ngu, Hatsigaire rimwe, nikimanyisa okwihwaho okw'ebiritengyetsibwa, nibyo byahangirwe, ngu ebyo ebitarikutengyetsibwa bibone kugumaho. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku twine obukama obutarikubaasa kutengyetsibwa, ka tusiime Ruhanga, tumuheereze nk'oku akunda, nitumuha ekitiinisa nitutiina; <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:14">Isa 33:14</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ruhanga waitu n'omuriro ogurikurya busha.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:7">2 Pet 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okukundana kugumeho. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:13">Rom 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:9">1 Pet 4:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:3">Kut 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Mutarireka kukunira abagyenyi; ahakuba omu muringo nk'ogwo hariho abaakuniire baamaraika batakimanyire. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:36">Mat 25:36</ref>. </char></note> Mwijukye abari omu bihome, nk'ababohirwe nabo; kandi mwijukye n'abarikwitwa kubi, ahakuba naimwe mwine emibiri. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Obushwere mwena mubuhe ekitiinisa; kandi ekitabo ky'obushwere kirekye kushiishwa, ahakuba abashambani Ruhanga aryabacwera orubanja. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Bir 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Mutarigira omutima ogurikukunda empiiha, ebi mwine bibe nibyo byabamara; ahakuba We akagira ati: Tindikutsigaho, kandi tindikuhemukaho na kakye. <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Zab 118:6</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo turikugambira, tutarikubanganisa, tuti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Mukama niwe muhwezi wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Tinditiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Omuntu naabaasa kungira ata?<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushanga Yesu aheeru y'orurembo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mwijukye abeebembezi baanyu, abaabagambiire ekigambo kya Ruhanga; mwetegyereze omuheru gw'amagara gaabo, mutooreze okwikiriza kwabo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Yesu Kristo tahinduka; oku abaire ari nyomwabazyo, n'eri izooba nikwo ari, kandi nikwo ariguma ebiro byona. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:14">Efe 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Mutahabisibwa enyegyesa ezihangire ez'emiringo mingi; ahakuba ni kirungi omutima kuhamibwa embabazi za Ruhanga, kunu ti migyenzo y'eby'okurya etaragasiire baagiikiriize. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Twine eitambiro eri abaheereza b'omu Ihema bataikirizibwa kurya ebiritambiirweho. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lev 16:27</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba enyamaishwa, ezi omunyamurwa omukuru atwara eshagama yaazo omu Mwanya ogurikwera okuba ebitambo by'ebibi, emitumbi yaazo bagyokyeza aheeru y'orusiisira. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Nikwo na Yesu yaabonaboneire aheeru y'eirembo, ngu abone kweza abantu n'eshagama ye. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:2">Heb 12:2</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo naitwe ka tushohore, tumushangye aheeru y'orusiisira, twekoreire ekijumo ahabwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:10">Heb 11:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba aha titwineho rurembo orurikugumaho, kureka nitusherura orundi oruriija. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 14:2">Hos 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ahabw'Ogwo ka tugume tutambe ekitambo ky'okusiima Ruhanga, nikyo kyana ky'eminwa erikuhimbisa eiziina rye. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:18">Fil 4:18</ref>. </char></note> Mutarireka kukorera abantu ebirungi, n'okukwatanisa omu bi mwine; ahakuba ebitambo nk'ebyo nibyo bishemeza Ruhanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:12">1 Tes 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:17">Ezk 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhurire abeebembezi baanyu, muboorobere; ahakuba nibo barinda amagara gaanyu, nk'abarikumanya ngu baryagabuuzibwa. Nabo babone kukora ekyo bashemereirwe, batagwirwe kubi; ahabw'okuba ekyo naimwe tikikaabagasira. <verse eid="HEB 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:12">2 Kor 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Mutushabire, ahakuba nituhamya ngu twine omutima ogutarikweshinja, nitwetenga kutwaza gye omuri byona. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Kandi nimbeeshengyereza munonga, mwezirikye kutushabira, mbone kurahuka kubagarurirwa juba.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:11">Zek 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:40">Yer 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yoh 10:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Ruhanga ow'obusingye, owaagarwire Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo okuruga omu bafu, Omuriisa w'entaama omukuru, ahabw'eshagama y'endagaano etahwaho, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />abahe ebirungi byona, mubone kukora ebi akunda, naakorera omuriimwe ebirikusiimwa omu maisho ge, ahabwa Yesu Kristo; aheebwe ekitiinisa ebiro byona. Amiina.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />B'eshe-emwe, nimbeeshengyereza, mwikirize ekigambo eki naabahabura, ahakuba naabahandiikira nincwera hagufu. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mumanye ngu ow'eishe-emwe Timoseo akarekurwa; ku ariija juba, turyabareebera hamwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mundamukize abeebembezi baanyu boona n'abarikwera boona. Aba Italia baabaramutsya. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Embabazi zigume naimwe mwena. Amiina.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>